        "title": "feat(vast): add Vast.ai SSH lease provider",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nCloses https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/issues/363\n\n- Add the Vast.ai direct SSH-lease provider with config/env/flag handling, provider registration, guarded auth, and provider matrix/docs/live-smoke coverage.\n- Implement Vast offer search, create/show/list/manage/destroy/SSH-key API flows, ownership labels, per-lease SSH key handling, release-action handling, recovery/rollback, and cleanup safety checks.\n- Address closeout review findings around documented Vast API payload shapes, v1 paginated instance listing, retained stopped claims, status-ready probes, numeric slug resolution, Tailscale preflight rejection, unsafe custom API URL components, and race-test timing stability.\n- Use Vast's rentable `ask_contract_id` for provisioning, bind destructive cleanup to the authenticated account and API endpoint, and bootstrap required SSH tools before applying the full readiness gate.\n\n## Verification\n\nExact head: `19523ad1eaf9d4e087c927805b7a28aa7e334c82` (rebased onto the 0.34.1 development head).\n\n- `go vet ./... && go test -race ./... && go build -trimpath -o bin/crabbox ./cmd/crabbox`\n- `go test -race ./internal/providers/vast` after each accepted review fix\n- `scripts/check-docs.sh` — 51 command docs, 70 providers, 203 Markdown files, and the generated docs site\n- `bash -n scripts/live-vast-smoke.sh`\n- `CRABBOX_LIVE=0 CRABBOX_LIVE_PROVIDERS=vast scripts/live-vast-smoke.sh` -> `classification=environment_blocked reason=CRABBOX_LIVE_not_enabled`\n- `CRABBOX_LIVE=1 CRABBOX_LIVE_PROVIDERS=vast CRABBOX_VAST_API_KEY= VAST_API_KEY= scripts/live-vast-smoke.sh` -> `classification=environment_blocked reason=VAST_API_KEY_missing`\n- `node --test scripts/live-vast-smoke.test.js` — 7 tests passed\n- `git diff --check`\n- Whole-branch autoreview found and fixed three actionable lifecycle defects: wrong offer identifier, cross-account 404 cleanup orphaning, and missing default-image tool bootstrap. Focused fix reviews and the final whole-branch review are clean with no accepted/actionable findings.\n- Exact-head public CI is terminal green: https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/actions/runs/28615313481\n\n## Remaining live gate\n\nNo billable Vast lifecycle was run because the credential session remains locked. Before merge, run the guarded smoke with an explicit conservative hourly cap and prove doctor, empty owned inventory, create/readiness, SSH `nvidia-smi`, list/status, stop/destroy, key cleanup, and final empty inventory.\n",
